WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.099
Training scope.

00:00:01.099 --> 00:00:03.957
Lifesaver Vision is a practice academy.

00:00:03.957 --> 00:00:13.997
Where an activity offers practice feedback, it is limited to sequence, hand-placement zone, rhythm, interruptions and posture heuristics.

00:00:13.997 --> 00:00:26.749
Hand tracking does not measure physical compression depth or force; those fields remain labelled ‘Not physically assessed’ unless a verified external CPR sensor is connected.
